ge graph, and deep PDF reading.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai/Agentero/releases/tag/v0.10.2","tags":["academics","agent","article","literature","paper","pdf","reference","research","thesis","zotero"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"Agent 友好的文献管理方式。","license":"MIT","licenseUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai/Agentero/blob/HEAD/LICENSE","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"传统文献管理器对 Agent 并不友好：阅读高亮和笔记被锁在单篇文件里，Agent 很难跨论文复用；每次对话都要重新提供上下文，缺少稳定的本地知识地图；PDF 对人友好，但对 Agent 来讲不是最舒服的阅读材料。Agentero 旨在构建 Agent 友好、Agent 原生的文献管理方式，探索人与 Agent 在文献管理中的协作方式。通过 ACP 连接本机 Agent（BYOA），支持划词对话、论文导入与 Skill 导入，兼容 Zotero 生态，提供论文翻译、双链与知识图谱、PDF 深度阅读等功能。","name":"Agentero","packageUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai/Agentero","publisher":"poco-ai","publisherUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai/Agentero/releases/tag/v0.10.2","tags":["agent","pdf","zotero","学术","引用","文献","文献管理","研究","论文"]}},"publisherUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai","releaseDate":"2026-09-12","releaseDateSource":"manifest","releaseNotesUrl":"https://github.com/poco-ai/Agentero/releases/tag/v0.10.2","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"97d6aa2689f0a05f7847653a62b8624720d15b5d","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/p/poco-ai/Agentero/0.10.2/poco-ai.Agentero.yaml","sha256":"8cd33bd31e3bb4997ae6400b3327d64742a4260d1a8b2534df677c8055c5b066"},{"path":"manifests/p/poco-ai/Agentero/0.10.2/poco-ai.Agentero.installer.yaml","sha256":"6989998aed888173fcd698f7557bdad743efcaf62a37c1b39b1f83f4e020575a"},{"path":"manifests/p/poco-ai/Agentero/0.10.2/poco-ai.Agentero.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"c67fd46b40d07c7814bc5c967aaa27b8817b63b638a6cc02e991cde9251058ca"},{"path":"manifests/p/poco-ai/Agentero/0.10.2/poco-ai.Agentero.locale.zh-CN.yaml","sha256":"6dac18cfb71dabac3772c97a7a0b509928e93c9a04b85d6b28b2f3d36c5f1dbd"}],"repository":"microsoft/winget-pkgs"},"version":"0.10.2"}